WEBVTT

00:13.115 --> 00:17.619
Pull the cords out of the wall Let the heavy

00:17.799 --> 00:23.505
feedback fall I don't wanna hear the overdrive I

00:23.525 --> 00:27.889
just wanna feel like we're alive Just the wood,

00:28.269 --> 00:30.511
the wire, and the hollow sound

00:33.554 --> 00:37.978
Before they try to run us to the ground

00:40.780 --> 00:47.602
Take the master tapes and let them burn There's a

00:47.702 --> 00:54.344
different kind of truth we have to learn No

00:54.504 --> 00:58.465
electric poles to hide the pain No screaming

00:58.585 --> 01:03.026
crowds out in the rain Just a quiet hum and a

01:03.126 --> 01:07.147
steady breath Walking on the edge of life and

01:07.527 --> 01:14.090
death We are unplugged, we are shutting down the

01:14.150 --> 01:21.712
grid Hiding in the shadows where we always hid

01:22.592 --> 01:26.112
Strip away the heavy metal, cut the power line

01:26.453 --> 01:31.053
Leave the crazy circus far behind When the amps

01:31.113 --> 01:35.534
go cold and the stage is bare I look across the

01:35.594 --> 01:38.375
room and you're still there

01:43.542 --> 01:49.307
And you're still there

01:52.150 --> 01:59.777
It takes a lot of nerve to just be still To stop the

01:59.957 --> 02:05.642
endless climbing of the hill But in this quiet

02:05.742 --> 02:09.946
room I find my grace

02:13.620 --> 02:21.225
The only anchor in this place We are unplugged We

02:21.305 --> 02:27.530
are shutting down the grid Hiding in the shadows

02:27.970 --> 02:32.914
Where we always hid Strip away the heavy metal,

02:32.954 --> 02:37.157
cut the power line Leave the crazy circus far

02:37.197 --> 02:42.221
behind When the amps go cold and the stage is bare

02:42.982 --> 02:46.965
I look across the room and you're still there

02:49.246 --> 02:56.932
Just the wood and the wire Unplugged

